      {
        "type": "sentence",
        "content": "In his late teens, South Korea's Yong-eun Yang, or\"y. E.,\" enjoyed lifting weights"
      },
      {
        "type": "sentence",
        "content": "and hoped to own his own gym someday. But that dream died when he hurt"
      },
      {
        "type": "sentence",
        "content": "himself in the gym. So at age 19, he took a part-time job at a golf course. He"
      },
      {
        "type": "sentence",
        "content": "picked up golf balls and began to observe other players. He started to practice"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "the game by himself late at night, and he even forced himself to get up early to"
      },
      {
        "type": "sentence",
        "content": "be at the course by 5:00 a.m. for more practice. This is how Y. E. taught himself"
      },
      {
        "type": "sentence",
        "content": "to play golf. His dedication and patience paid off. He became a professional"
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": "golfer in 1995, and, in 2009, this talented man won his first championship,"
      },
